<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>All Yours</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Normani</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">DOPAMINE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0FK76UEefHKQ78AXEWJY31</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.484" end="00:15.629">There's something about you I'm likin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.629" end="00:17.377">Bit too much is a bit frightening</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.377" end="00:19.177">Got a bit of bite to you like Python</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.177" end="00:20.904">Got a bit of fight to you like Tyson</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.904" end="00:22.673">All my things sound like they sin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.673" end="00:24.426">Never planned to be in like I'm in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.426" end="00:27.999">How you could put this cherry on this cake and make it icing?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.999" end="00:29.980">Said, mmm (That's all my spread)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.980" end="00:31.730">Mmm (Like a wildfire, like)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.730" end="00:33.478">Mmm (I don't mind, like)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.478" end="00:35.678">Mmm (Let's go twice, like)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.678" end="00:37.438">Flip it, go, flip it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.438" end="00:38.971">Drippin' all in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.971" end="00:42.766">This kitty got that Midas touch, you turn it gold in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.766" end="00:44.266">Mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.848" end="00:45.584">In your head, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.584" end="00:47.365">In your bed, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.365" end="00:49.122">I'm just like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.122" end="00:50.874">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.874" end="00:52.642">Take it there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.642" end="00:54.264">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.264" end="00:56.191">Mm-ah-mm, mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.191" end="00:57.943">In your head, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.943" end="00:59.709">In your bed, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.709" end="01:01.461">I'm just like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.461" end="01:03.245">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.245" end="01:05.013">Take it there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.013" end="01:06.630">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.630" end="01:09.184">Mm-ah-mm, mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.184" end="01:10.684">Mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.859" end="01:12.397">'Cause you got that automatic kind of magic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.397" end="01:16.911">Put it all on me, on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.911" end="01:19.830">In a weekend rendezvous, c'est vous, les vous, if you want to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.830" end="01:23.997">We can go deep, deep, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.997" end="01:25.799">Do you wanna go deep, deep, deep, deep?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.799" end="01:27.488">I'ma pull it like beep, beep, beep, beep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.488" end="01:29.232">We can take a leap, leap, believe me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.232" end="01:31.016">Turn it over like you turn a new leaf</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.016" end="01:32.816">Baby, you could come pick from my tree</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.816" end="01:34.585">Know I got it like sweet, sweet, sweet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.585" end="01:36.417">All up in it till your knees go weak</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.417" end="01:38.509">All up in it till you exhale, breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.509" end="01:40.589">Said, mmm (That's all my spread)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.589" end="01:42.303">Mmm (Like a wildfire, like)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.303" end="01:44.081">Mmm (I don't mind, like)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.081" end="01:46.314">Mmm (Let's go twice, like)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.314" end="01:48.006">Flip it, go, flip it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.006" end="01:49.574">Drippin' all in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.574" end="01:53.342">This kitty got that Midas touch, you turn it gold in it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.342" end="01:54.842">Mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.432" end="01:56.189">In your head, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.189" end="01:57.973">In your bed, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.973" end="01:59.709">I'm just like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.709" end="02:01.493">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.493" end="02:03.302">Take it there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.302" end="02:04.865">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.865" end="02:06.787">Mmm-ah-mm, mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.787" end="02:08.568">In your head, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.568" end="02:10.347">In your bed, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.347" end="02:12.088">I'm just like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.088" end="02:13.819">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.819" end="02:15.574">Take it there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.574" end="02:17.231">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.231" end="02:19.772">Mmm-ah-mm, mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.772" end="02:21.272">Mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.920" end="02:27.948">I'm all yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.948" end="02:34.982">I'm all yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.982" end="02:42.085">From the stairs, to the bed, to the floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.085" end="02:46.888">I'm all yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.888" end="02:49.835">You're all mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.835" end="02:51.335">Mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.952" end="02:52.704">In your head, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.704" end="02:54.472">In your bed, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.472" end="02:56.221">I'm just like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.221" end="02:58.021">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.021" end="02:59.789">Take it there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.789" end="03:01.398">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.398" end="03:03.320">Mmm-ah-mm, mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.320" end="03:05.047">In your head, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.047" end="03:06.815">In your bed, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.815" end="03:08.583">I'm just like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.583" end="03:10.349">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.349" end="03:12.101">Take it there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.101" end="03:13.729">Right there, like (Mm-ah, mm-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.729" end="03:16.283">Mmm-ah-mm, mm-ah, mm-ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.283" end="03:20.283">Mm-ah, mm-ah</p></div></body></tt>